=== a callee that a later call binds in the frame ===
PASS: a call that runs the helper only after the frame word exists
PASS: the same call after another call compiled the helper
=== a helper without locals ===
PASS: first call
PASS: second call, reusing the compiled body
PASS: a call too short to compile it
=== a helper defined twice in one call ===
PASS: the later definition wins
PASS: and again in the next call
=== a helper over a local that differs per call ===
PASS: first local
PASS: second local
PASS: third local
